      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MAGICAL ANG (1) is a talented dog who is a winner of 11 races and filled a minor placing latest when third at Gosford (29.86). Form here at the trip sound including seven wins. Has performed well from this box with a win and three minor placings to her name from five starts. Rates highly and will give a great sight. KIWI EVOCA (2) is progressing well scoring last time out (29.44) at Sandown and bringing up his 4th career win. The form from his last run is stacking up nicely. Leading chance again. CONDO BANDIT (3) has a fair record and proved too strong last time to win by a neck at The Gardens in a handy 29.75 beating Repeat The Same. Won at her only start from this box. Can make it back-to-back wins. O'KEEFE (8) did a good job to finish third last time out over 520m at this track (30.24) in a Free For All, the second top-three finish on the trot.",
